/*
  PrivacySection.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0209 · PrivacySection (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `PrivacySection` resolves (table "PrivacySection") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings`
  master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each
  parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first groups are the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/settings/components/PrivacySection.tsx + the ConfirmDialog it mounts). The
  trailing group backs the native-only chrome the Apple HIG states contract requires
  (consent-policy status banner, loading + empty copy, accessibility).
*/

